    <subfield code="a">"Snapshots documenting a family's drive through the Scandinavian countryside are gathered in this book with a casual documentary approach. Sweeping vistas of seashores, open grasslands, and rolling mountains are captured in multiple shots, which are joined across fold-out pages. The conjoined images in combination with a uniquely folded and bound form create a hybrid between a vacation photo album and a home movie." Printed Matter.</subfield>
